### Aynı key ile iki kez gönder: ikincisi Idempotent-Replayed: true döner, ödeme tek kalır
POST http://localhost:5000/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{ "amount": 100, "currency": "TRY" }

### Aynı key, farklı body -> 422
POST http://localhost:5000/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{ "amount": 999, "currency": "TRY" }

### Key yok -> 400
POST http://localhost:5000/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100, "currency": "TRY" }

### Oluşan ödemeler
GET http://localhost:5000/payments
